          "**Reversal curse** (Berglund et al. 2023)",
          "If trained on \"A is B,\" can the model infer \"B is A\"?",
          "GPT-4 and others fail — training on \"Olaf Scholz is Chancellor of Germany\" does NOT produce \"The Chancellor of Germany is Olaf Scholz\" reliably"
        ],
        [
          "**Marcus's critique** (2020+)",
          "Systematic variable binding: \"every A that R's a B, S's a C\"",
          "LLMs approximate via distributional statistics but fail on novel variable-binding patterns outside training distribution"
        ]
      ]
